<!--
  Screenshot test glyph: the Material bolt icon. The renderer tints it, so the fill here is white.

  Declared at 44dp rather than 24dp: RemoteViews cannot size an ImageView before API 31, so the
  renderer caps it with setMaxWidth / setMaxHeight instead, which only shrinks. The intrinsic size
  therefore has to cover the largest glyph drawn, 44dp in a large bulb.
-->
